title: "semRTI"
abstract: "A self-contained, menu-driven pipeline that converts Reflectance Transformation Imaging (RTI) survey data into a FAIR-compliant RDF/Turtle Knowledge Graph, aligned to the Cultural Heritage Survey Ontology Design Pattern (CHS-ODP) and ArCo."
